Name Appearance
"Font:" [dropdown] tooltip: Choose the font from the list of found installed fonts on your system. This is the font that will be used for everythingin the nameplate.
"Bold:" [Checkbox] tooltip: Render nameplates in a bold version of your selected font.
"Max Font Size:" [textbox] tooltip: The maximum size a nameplate will be. Nameplates closer to the camera will approach this size.
"Min Font Size:" [textbox] tooltip: The minimum size a nameplate wil be. Nameplates further from the camera will never get smaller than this size.
"Outline thickness: " [radio buttons, 0-3] tooltip: Choose the thickness of the outline effect on nameplate fonts. 0 is no outline.

Player Icons
"Show Icons:" [check box] tooldtip: Checked shows icons next to player names. These include icons like linkshells, levelsync and lfp.
"Scale:" [percentage slider] tooltip: Set the scale of all icons in player nameplates.
"Padding:" [textbox] tooldtip: Defines the gap between the icon and player name.

Mob Nameplates
"Show Level / Range:" [checkbox] tooltip: Show the checked level or known level range. Off hides [level] and the standard Lv prefix without changing saved formats.
"Show Aggro Icons:" [checkbox] tooltip: Show inline [aggro] icons beside mob names. Check-detail detection/link icons are controlled separately by Text Only.
"Mob Letters:" [experimental checkbox] tooltip: Label zone spawn slots a-z, wrapping after 26; deterministic by exact mob name and entity-index order in the bundled zone table, not encounter order. Off by default. Requires matching zone tables across users. Unknown/renamed slots are unlabelled. Adds a suffix unless [letter] is placed explicitly.
"Double Letters:" [checkbox, shown while Mob Letters is on] tooltip: Where an area has more than 26 slots of one name, go on from Z to AA, AB and so on, in one wider badge, in place of starting again at A. Off by default.
"Mob Format:" [textbox] tooltip: Custom mob nameplate string. Tokens: [name], [level], [aggro], [distance], [checked], [letter]. Default: [aggro] Lv [level]. [name].

Check
"Show Check:" [check box] tooltip: When enabled performing a /check on a mob will display check information on the nameplate.
"Check Scale:" [slider] tooltip: Set the scale of the /check info.
"Brief Difficulty:" [checkbox] tooltip: When enabled mob difficulties such as Easy Prey or Incredibly Tough will appear in a shortened form such as EP or IT.
"Text Only" [checkbox] tooltip: When enabled check details will not include icons. The default is disabled so icons will be shown.

NM Tracking (a tab of its own, after Filters)
Tracked Monster
"Tracked NM:" [experimental dropdown] tooltip: Choose a notorious monster of the current area to hunt, or None. Its nameplate and its placeholders' show the hunt icon (assets/special/hunt.png) in place of the [aggro] icon. The choice is kept when leaving the area.
"Hunt Target Scale:" [percentage slider, 100-200, shown only while an NM is tracked] tooltip: Enlarge the tracked monster's nameplate. 100% is the size of every other name. Placeholders are not enlarged.
"Label Placeholders:" [checkbox, shown only when the tracked NM has placeholders] tooltip: Name the tracked monster's placeholders "Placeholder" in place of their own name. On by default.
